Not
If loc005e
Push "d1", "-"
SetVariable
Jump loc008b
loc005e:Push "d1", 10, "_root"
GetVariable
Push "skill"
GetMember
Push 14
GetMember
Push 2
Multiply
Add2
Push "% of enemy life"
Add2
SetVariable
loc008b:Push "d2", 10, "_root"
